{"steam_appid":4074010,"steam_name":"Dig, Dig, Die","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4074010/36598694/e88cdb31fa856da1f9225ed9bb72b2d4a904832f/1782286344/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1782286861","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257364680/3cadf16e24c58d5ce80445e05b50252f565ed663/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1782286861","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/109ad0fb82c2cbaf702f4b5549ad4eefce81771f/ss_109ad0fb82c2cbaf702f4b5549ad4eefce81771f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786016977","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/b6bc46a68787c923611a4c9c4bc0b8e3936cf565/ss_b6bc46a68787c923611a4c9c4bc0b8e3936cf565.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786016977","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/69769550d364250debedb402cbedb0a02b3bf6ab/ss_69769550d364250debedb402cbedb0a02b3bf6ab.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786016977","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/a663f894682cc47169ad1e20184b485ad4e6b429/ss_a663f894682cc47169ad1e20184b485ad4e6b429.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786016977","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/4eb18335abda1c38717f456549e83588166dda5e/ss_4eb18335abda1c38717f456549e83588166dda5e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786016977"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op horror for 1–6 players with voice chat and terrifying monsters. Board a cursed flying ship and raid graveyards using shovels, crowbars, and improvised weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/6b6aca65653a4e475c0e532aa80895e4.poster.avif?t=1786016977\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/6b6aca65653a4e475c0e532aa80895e4.webm?t=1786016977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/6b6aca65653a4e475c0e532aa80895e4.mp4?t=1786016977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIG GRAVES FOR TREASURE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffins and crypts hide loot: some give powerful boosts (speed, super-jump, and more), some bring curses… You must also remember about monsters that might burst out of the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/9a3f77bd74693558ff38f9ae949a9577.poster.avif?t=1786016977\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/9a3f77bd74693558ff38f9ae949a9577.webm?t=1786016977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/9a3f77bd74693558ff38f9ae949a9577.mp4?t=1786016977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WATCH YOUR NOISE</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most monsters hear everything: from shovels to voice chat. Scream once, and they’ll come for you. Feeling unlucky? A UFO could beam you straight into space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/dfd2ba1059e2025c4ef1ea2b7cf435af.poster.avif?t=1786016977\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/dfd2ba1059e2025c4ef1ea2b7cf435af.webm?t=1786016977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/dfd2ba1059e2025c4ef1ea2b7cf435af.mp4?t=1786016977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SPEND YOUR HAUL ON THE SHIP</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vending machines dish out boosters and handy items, while the ship’s casino - blackjack, roulette and thimbles - lets you multiply your loot… or lose it all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/84fb3d97e097eb63fc4672ce8334f42d.poster.avif?t=1786016977\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/84fb3d97e097eb63fc4672ce8334f42d.webm?t=1786016977\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4074010/extras/84fb3d97e097eb63fc4672ce8334f42d.mp4?t=1786016977\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRAVEYARDS ARE BETTER WITH FRIENDS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite up to 5 friends on Steam and dive into the chaos together. Solo? Go ahead - but nobody will hear you scream.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 1–6 players in online co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Proximity voice chat with special voice effects </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Monsters that hunt by sound - and UFO abductions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Boosters and cursed items straight from the graves </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Full shipboard casino and bar </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Pure chaos, friend betrayal, and nonstop mayhem</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 8700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","Massively Multiplayer"],"developers":["Alice Games"],"publishers":["Alice Games"],"release_date":"Aug 6, 2026"}